Theoretical basis of machine learning through examples and hands- on coding
exercises. Machine learning techniques for supervised learning, unsupervised learning,
and reinforcement learning. Neural networks, Radial basis functions, Kernel machines,
Dimensionality reduction and clustering, Bayesian networks, Hidden Markov Models,
Multiple learners, Markov decision process. Machine learning experiments.
