Concepts and goals of various cryptographic techniques for multimedia
communication including symmetrical encryption algorithms, public key encryption
algorithms, one way hash function, message authentication codes, digital signature,
speech security systems, principles of JPEG, MPEG, selective encryption, problems
of copyright violation and protection concepts. Discussion on case studies. Design
and implement those techniques for a practical system through a collaborative
problem-based learning focusing on teamwork and problem-solving skills building.
Presentations and discussions of views about security in the considered systems.
