This subject covers the study of the origin and development of civilization during
the five historical periods—prehistoric, ancient, middle age, modern, and the present
period.

The study will focus on significant social, economic and political events resulting
from values and attitudes due to customs, beliefs and innovations, including the ability to
communicate through art and literature based on several perspectives and periods.

