This course aims at developing academic listening and speaking skills necessary for
learners in international programs. The teaching and learning styles involve an integration of
English with content areas related to the learners’ fields.

The course aims to enable learners
to be able to listen to English lectures in their fields, ask and appropriately respond to
questions, share ideas and express opinions, and read and summarize text. Learners will
discuss and lead a discussion, make an effective oral presentation, and actively participate
in the session. LNG 107 การอ่านและการเขียนเชิงวิชาการ
